        {
            "block_label": "paragraph_title",
            "block_content": "Division 1-Superannuation data and payment regulations and standards \n",
            "block_bbox": [
                150,
                296,
                1009,
                360
            ],
            "block_id": 3,
            "block_order": 2
        },
        {
            "block_label": "paragraph_title",
            "block_content": "34H Object of Part ",
            "block_bbox": [
                149,
                397,
                402,
                424
            ],
            "block_id": 4,
            "block_order": 3
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(1) The object of this Part is to further the interests of beneficiaries of eligible superannuation entities by improving the productivity of the superannuation system.\n",
            "block_bbox": [
                244,
                447,
                1011,
                530
            ],
            "block_id": 5,
            "block_order": 4
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(2) The Part does this by providing for a system of standards relating to payments and information connected with the operation of.eligible superannuation entities.\n",
            "block_bbox": [
                245,
                553,
                1009,
                636
            ],
            "block_id": 6,
            "block_order": 5
        },
        {
            "block_label": "paragraph_title",
            "block_content": "34J Alternative constitutional basis ",
            "block_bbox": [
                152,
                676,
                610,
                700
            ],
            "block_id": 7,
            "block_order": 6
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Without limiting its effect apart from this section, this Part also has the effect it would have if each reference to an employer were, by.express provision, confined to an employer that is a corporation to which paragraph 51(xx) of the Constitution applies.",
            "block_bbox": [
                291,
                723,
                1039,
                841
            ],
            "block_id": 8,
            "block_order": 7
        },
        {
            "block_label": "paragraph_title",
            "block_content": "34K Superannuation data and payment regulations and standards ",
            "block_bbox": [
                154,
                875,
                1021,
                910
            ],
            "block_id": 9,
            "block_order": 8
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(1) The regulations may make provision for and in relation to superannuation data and payment matters, to be complied with by:.(a) trustees of eligible superannuation entities; and ",
            "block_bbox": [
                250,
                929,
                1040,
                1017
            ],
            "block_id": 10,
            "block_order": 9
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(b) employers in their dealings with eligible superannuation entities.\n",
            "block_bbox": [
                315,
                1023,
                992,
                1079
            ],
            "block_id": 11,
            "block_order": 10
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(2) The regulations may prescribe different requirements for different.classes of eligible superannuation entity or employer.",
            "block_bbox": [
                255,
                1102,
                1033,
                1158
            ],
            "block_id": 12,
            "block_order": 11
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(3) The Commissioner of Taxation may, by legislative instrument,determine standards (superannuation data and payment ",
            "block_bbox": [
                259,
